# Holding site design

Read and obey [DESIGN.md](DESIGN.md) before changing pages, tokens, or CSS.

- Do not invent colours, typefaces, or a second palette. Use `paper` / `ink` / `muted` / `rule` / `clay` only.
- Clay is focus/accent, not a big CTA fill. Ink for filled controls.
- Keep GitHub Pages static: committed HTML + `assets/site.css`. No runtime, no tracking pixels. Keep the existing stylesheet preload; do not add more.
- After token or utility-class changes, run `npm run build:css` and commit the rebuilt stylesheet.
- Homepage main is the single tagline only. Contact / Survey / Privacy live in the footer as those labels.
- Never use `[&_p]:m-0`. Use real `gap-y-*` (or winning margins) for stacks.
- Do not rewrite privacy legal copy to adjust spacing. Do not mention CPD in blurbs.
- Names: product Good Standing; trading Good Standing Software; legal Good Standing Software Ltd.
